###
# Calculate electricity Bill
###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/calculate-bill/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "units": 250
}


###
# Calculate Units
###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/calculate-units/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "previous_reading": 1250,
    "current_reading": 1500
}


